BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261020T223000Z
DTEND:20261021T000000Z
DTSTAMP:20261020T000000Z
SUMMARY:Film and Fidget
DESCRIPTION:Come watch "Scooby Doo" (2002) while keeping your hands busy 
 with a small activity. For this event’s activity\, we’ll be making 
 Halloween-themed air dry clay figures. All ages are welcome to 
 attend.\n\nIf you want to bring your own project to work on or just watch 
 the film\, no registration is required!
ORGANIZER;CN="Mikaela Neubauer":MAILTO:mneubauer@cityofbrookings-sd.gov
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-19943-17638503
URL:https://brookingslibrary.libcal.com/event/17638503
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261021T200000Z
DTEND:20261021T204500Z
DTSTAMP:20261021T000000Z
SUMMARY:Tween the Pages Book Club - Group 2
DESCRIPTION:This book club is for kids in grades 4 and 5.  Receive a copy 
 of the book and then discuss it while we enjoy some snacks. \n\nThis 
 month's book is Exit Nowhere by Juliana Brandt.\n\nThe Tween the Pages Book 
 Club has two sessions for each book to accommodate more kids.  Please sign 
 up for one date each month. \n\nYour copy of the book will be waiting for 
 you to pick up at the circulation desk at the Library.
ORGANIZER;CN="Kristen Prout":MAILTO:kprout@cityofbrookings-sd.gov
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-19943-17549128
URL:https://brookingslibrary.libcal.com/event/17549128
END:VEVENT
