BEGIN:VEVENT
DTSTART:20261102T220000Z
DTEND:20261102T222000Z
DTSTAMP:20261102T000000Z
SUMMARY:House Party Escape Room- Slot 1
DESCRIPTION:Your roommate threw an epic house party last night\, but now 
 your car keys are nowhere to be found\, and you can’t miss your big 
 interview! You and your friends will have to work together to find clues\, 
 solve puzzles\, and track down the keys in the chaos.\n\nSign up for an 
 evening time slot for your group of six or fewer people starting October 
 26. Participants must be 12 . PLEASE REGISTER EACH MEMBER OF YOUR TEAM (for 
 example\, if you have 3 team members\, register for 3 spots.)
ORGANIZER;CN="Mikaela Neubauer":MAILTO:mneubauer@cityofbrookings-sd.gov
CATEGORIES:
UID:LibCal-19943-17638554
URL:https://brookingslibrary.libcal.com/event/17638554
